#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:2
msgid "CMUcam3 Windows Quick Start Guide"
msgstr "CMUcam3 vodič za brzi početak za Windows"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:4
msgid ""
"This is for advanced users. For more detailed instructions see "
":doc:`documentation`. You can grab a bundled version of all of this software"
" from the :doc:`downloads` page."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je za napredne korisnike. Za detaljnije upute pogledajte "
":doc:`documentation`. Skupnu verziju svog ovog softvera možete preuzeti sa "
"stranice :doc:`downloads`."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:8
msgid "Download and install cygwin"
msgstr "Preuzmite i instalirajte cygwin"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:10
msgid "`http://www.cygwin.com <http://www.cygwin.com>`__"
msgstr "`http://www.cygwin.com <http://www.cygwin.com>`__"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:11
msgid "Make sure to install \"Make\", \"CVS\", \"openssh\""
msgstr "Obavezno instalirajte \"Make\", \"CVS\", \"openssh\""

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:13
msgid ""
"Go to `CodeSourcery ARM compiler download site "
"<http://www.codesourcery.com/gnu_toolchains/arm/download.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"Idite na `stranicu za preuzimanje CodeSourcery ARM kompajlera "
"<http://www.codesourcery.com/gnu_toolchains/arm/download.html>`__"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:15
msgid "Get the \"EABI\" or \"Bare Metal\" target for Windows"
msgstr "Dohvatite \"EABI\" ili \"Bare Metal\" cilj (target) za Windows"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:16
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Instalacija"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:18
msgid "Go to `http://www.lpc2100.com <http://www.lpc2100.com>`__"
msgstr "Idite na `http://www.lpc2100.com <http://www.lpc2100.com>`__"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:20
msgid "Download and Install LPC ISP"
msgstr "Preuzmite i instalirajte LPC ISP"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:21
msgid ""
"`http://www.semiconductors.philips.com/files/products/standard/microcontrollers/utilities/lpc2000_flash_utility.zip"
" "
"<http://www.semiconductors.philips.com/files/products/standard/microcontrollers/utilities/lpc2000_flash_utility.zip>`__"
msgstr ""
"`http://www.semiconductors.philips.com/files/products/standard/microcontrollers/utilities/lpc2000_flash_utility.zip"
" "
"<http://www.semiconductors.philips.com/files/products/standard/microcontrollers/utilities/lpc2000_flash_utility.zip>`__"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:23
msgid "Download cc3 source"
msgstr "Preuzmite cc3 izvorni kod"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:25
msgid "Get a zip of the latest stable snapshot from our :doc:`downloads` page"
msgstr ""
"Dohvatite zip najnovijeg stabilnog snimka s naše stranice :doc:`downloads`"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:26
msgid "**or** checkout a fresh copy from svn by typing:"
msgstr "**ili** preuzmite svježu kopiju iz svn-a upisivanjem:"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:32
msgid "Open up Cygwin Shell"
msgstr "Otvorite Cygwin Shell"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:34
msgid "Go to cc3"
msgstr "Idite u cc3"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:36
msgid "``cd c:`` to get to c drive, then cd into the ``cc3`` directory"
msgstr "``cd c:`` da biste došli do c pogona, zatim cd u direktorij ``cc3``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:37
msgid "typing ``ls`` will list all of the files"
msgstr "upisivanje ``ls`` će izlistati sve datoteke"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:39
msgid "Type ``make``"
msgstr "Upišite ``make``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:41
msgid "typing ``make clean`` will remove all compiled files."
msgstr "upisivanje ``make clean`` će ukloniti sve kompajlirane datoteke."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:42
msgid ""
"make needs to be run in the root directory before you can compile individual"
" projects"
msgstr ""
"make se mora pokrenuti u korijenskom direktoriju prije nego što možete "
"kompajlirati pojedinačne projekte"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:44
msgid "Startup in programming mode"
msgstr "Pokretanje u programskom načinu rada"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:46
msgid ""
"Hold in push button while turning on power to startup in programming mode"
msgstr ""
"Držite pritisnutu tipku dok uključujete napajanje kako biste pokrenuli u "
"načinu programiranja"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:48
msgid "Open LPC ISP and load compiled hex file"
msgstr "Otvorite LPC ISP i učitajte kompajliranu hex datoteku"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:50
msgid "Browse to ``cc3/projects/cmucam2/cmucam2_lpc2106-cmucam3.hex``"
msgstr "Otvorite ``cc3/projects/cmucam2/cmucam2_lpc2106-cmucam3.hex``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:51
msgid "Flash board"
msgstr "Flashajte ploču"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:52
msgid "Close ISP program"
msgstr "Zatvorite ISP program"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:54
msgid "Open up a terminal program"
msgstr "Otvorite terminalski program"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:56
msgid "Power Cycle Board"
msgstr "Ciklus napajanja pločice"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:57
msgid "A Green Power LED should turn on"
msgstr "Trebala bi se upaliti zelena LED dioda napajanja"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:58
msgid ""
"If the code is running correctly, the red LED will turn off and the blue and"
" yellow LEDs will dimly illuminate"
msgstr ""
"Ako se kod izvršava ispravno, crveni LED će se ugasiti, a plavi i žuti LED-"
"ovi će slabo zasvijetliti"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:59
msgid "Make sure it prints a startup message"
msgstr "Provjerite ispisuje li poruku o pokretanju"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:61
msgid "Use a Graphical User Interface to View Images and Focus Camera"
msgstr ""
"Koristite grafičko korisničko sučelje za pregled slika i fokusiranje kamere"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:63
msgid "Option 1: CMUcam3 Frame Grab Utility"
msgstr "Opcija 1: CMUcam3 Frame Grab uslužni program"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:65
msgid ""
"Download the CMUcam3 Frame Grab Utility and install .NET (both on the "
":doc:`downloads` page)"
msgstr ""
"Preuzmite CMUcam3 Frame Grab Utility i instalirajte .NET (oboje na stranici "
":doc:`downloads`)"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:66
msgid "Double Click on \"CMUcam3 Frame Grabber.exe\""
msgstr "Dvaput kliknite na \"CMUcam3 Frame Grabber.exe\""

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:67
msgid "Select Correct COM port and Press \"Connect\""
msgstr "Odaberite ispravan COM priključak i pritisnite \"Connect\""

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:68
msgid ""
"Click \"Send\" button to check for an \"ACK\" message to see if the port is "
"connected"
msgstr ""
"Kliknite tipku \"Send\" za provjeru \"ACK\" poruke kako biste vidjeli je li "
"priključak spojen"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:69
msgid "Click \"Grab Frame\" to grab a sample image"
msgstr "Kliknite \"Grab Frame\" za dohvat uzorka slike"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:71
msgid "Option 2: CMUcam2 GUI"
msgstr "Opcija 2: CMUcam2 GUI"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:73
msgid "See the CMUcam2 GUI documentation"
msgstr "Pogledajte CMUcam2 GUI dokumentaciju"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:74
msgid "Check if GUI detects camera and can send frame"
msgstr "Provjerite otkriva li GUI kameru i može li poslati sličicu"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/windows-quick-start.rst:75
msgid ""
"GUI does not set serial port correctly, so a terminal program must be run in"
" between downloading from the ISP and use of the CMUcam2 GUI"
msgstr ""
"GUI ne postavlja ispravno serijski priključak, pa se između preuzimanja iz "
"ISP-a i korištenja CMUcam2 GUI-ja mora pokrenuti terminalski program"
